ube動画/FANBOX等サムネイルの使用を希望しております。もし可能な場合は透過PNG又はPSD形式ですと、大変有難く存じます…！\n\n御多忙の折大変恐縮ではございますが、\n何卒ご検討の程よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://mobile.twitter.com/RICORICO_SHR1NE/status/1558663867445567488", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KamakuraYume/works/35", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/83c22d77/uploads/origins/e8a3b21e-2be9-4b9c-b8b2-0bc288cf5b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f91eac2003c97ebccdc05f8978c4869", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/83c22d77/uploads/origins/e8a3b21e-2be9-4b9c-b8b2-0bc288cf5b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7f91eac2003c97ebccdc05f8978c4869, https://si.imgix.net/83c22d77/uploads/origins/e8a3b21e-2be9-4b9c-b8b2-0bc288cf5b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5043b2df1e8c24553049550981bff487 2x, https://si.imgix.net/83c22d77/uploads/origins/e8a3b21e-2be9-4b9c-b8b2-0bc288cf5b5f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=749c42db413209c86747d22d19f925f2 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Vtuberの愛園志乃さんを書いて欲しいです。構図はお任せしても大丈夫ですか？背景は完全透過でお願いします", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@KamakuraYume/works/34", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/2880aae1/uploads/origins/263b5f9c-5f02-446f-b075-ae8cc2713f03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a7c7a8d254c15e90e053aef85ea766d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/2880aae1/uploads/origins/263b5f9c-5f02-446f-b075-ae8cc2713f03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9a7c7a8d254c15e90e053aef85ea766d, https://si.imgix.net/2880aae1/uploads/origins/263b5f9c-5f02-446f-b075-ae8cc2713f03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0b6992d5cb47f77f47dcfdc489a20325 2x, https://si.imgix.net/2880aae1/uploads/origins/263b5f9c-5f02-446f-b075-ae8cc2713f03?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&